00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:13.319
Nagpakita ng napakataas na tugma sina Wu Feifei at Gao Feng .

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.440
Mayroon din silang direktang biyolohikal na ugnayan

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:17.400
